            "content": "<h4>Global Jeans Brand</h4><p>Denim • VMD Optimization • Multiple locations</p><p>Major global denim brand sought to optimize VMD performance in multi-brand retail environments. Focused on identifying which fixture layouts produce higher engagement and conversion.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>Identified optimal fixture placements</li><li>Improved engagement through layout adjustments</li><li>Standardized best practices across stores</li></ul>",
